# XILINDRO alone in the Corrigida's fair fight (`fight_fair`, docs/fights/FAIRNESS.md
# "Checks"): a masher that presses A (the punch) every beat (200 ms) from the
# round's start must not win. It throws most punches out of reach, at the
# opponent waiting one step away, which then steps in on the whiff: the
# strike comes while the fighter is still in its 3-beat punch.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame xilindro --headless --ms 100000 --fix all --input tools/play/xilindro-fair-mash.input
#
# It lands 11 of its punches in a wind-up (of 41 tells) and is knocked out
# at about 79 s, the opponent at 67: the window closes at 83600.
# The lines below are `tools/fight_plan.py --player mash`'s.
50 ?fight_controls_screen key return
50 ?fight_controls_screen delay 2050
# fair-plan fight begin
+50 ?fight_fair key a
+200 ?fight_fair key a
